OL,3,GNEWSALabour sees off Green challenge to
OL,4,Awin Holborn by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has won the Holborn and St
OL,7,FPancras by-election, seeing off a
OL,8,Fchallenge from Green Party leader Zack
OL,9,FPolanski.
OL,11,FCamden council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali
OL,12,Fheld the north London seat for Labour,
OL,13,Fbut the party's majority was reduced
OL,14,Ffrom 11,572 to 3,364.
OL,16,FAt a victory rally, Abdi-Wali told
OL,17,Fsupporters: "People voted for hope and
OL,18,Fnow we're going to be able to deliver
OL,19,Ffor them."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
