OL,3,GNEWSALabour sees off Green challenge to
OL,4,Awin Holborn by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe by-election, which was triggered
OL,7,Fafter former Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,8,FStarmer stood down as an MP, had been
OL,9,Fseen as a key test of whether Labour
OL,10,Funder Andy Burnham can win over voters
OL,11,Fwho have switched to the Greens.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
